damaged_code:
```rust
struct Discussion {
    availability: Option<DiscussionDescriptor>, // None = either disabled, not requested, or not ready
}
```

fix:
Define an explicit enum (Standard Type) to model all the possible unavailability scenarios clearly.
```rust
enum DiscussionAvailability {
    AddOnNotEnabled,
    NotRequested,
    Requested,
    Ready(DiscussionDescriptor),
}

struct Discussion {
    availability: DiscussionAvailability,
}
```
